flowchart TD
    Q[Candidate task and campaign constraints] --> P[Deterministic parse and cheap filters]
    P --> R{Current external facts needed?}
    R -->|yes| WEB[Permissioned public retrieval]
    WEB --> E[Capture evidence time source and contradictions]
    R -->|no| LOCAL[Candidate evidence only]
    E --> REASON[Qualified local model - thinking enabled]
    LOCAL --> REASON
    REASON --> CHECK[Schema source numeric and policy validation]
    CHECK -->|bounded repair| REASON
    CHECK -->|valid| REVIEW[Candidate review with evidence summary]
    CHECK -->|unresolved| BLOCK[Draft / unknown / blocked - honest limit]
    REVIEW --> PREP[Prepared packet]
    PREP --> APPROVAL[Separate prefill and submit approvals]
